CHALLENGE 3: THE UNIVERSAL TRANSFORMER (GENERIC INTERFACES)
================================================================================
1. THE INTERFACE:
   - Create an interface `Transformer<I, O>`.
   - Define one method: `O transform(I input);`.

2. THE IMPLEMENTATIONS:
   - CLASS A: `StringLengthCounter` implementing `Transformer<String, Integer>`.
     (Should return input.length()).
   - CLASS B: `ListFirstElement<T>` implementing `Transformer<List<T>, T>`.
     (Should return input.get(0)).

3. THE TEST:
   - Use `StringLengthCounter` to transform the string "Generics" into an Integer.
   - Use `ListFirstElement<Double>` to transform a List of [1.1, 2.2, 3.3]
     into the single Double 1.1.
